    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA spacious fourth-floor two-bedroom apartment with secure underground parking and an exceptional city location at Heuston South Quarter.\n\nSituated on the fourth floor of the Hibernia Building within Heuston South Quarter, Apartment 42 is a superbly presented two-bedroom apartment extending to a generously proportioned layout and benefitting from an underground designated car parking space.\n\nThis bright and spacious residence is designed for modern living, with a well-appointed open plan kitchen, dining and living area. Large windows flood the accommodation with natural light while framing attractive views towards the grounds of the Irish Museum of Modern Art (IMMA), creating a peaceful backdrop in an otherwise vibrant city setting.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open plan living/dining room with adjoining kitchen, two generously sized double bedrooms, each benefiting from excellent storage and ensuite bathrooms. A further guest WC completes the accommodation.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, superb transport links, attractive outlooks and secure parking, Apartment 42 represents an outstanding opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike."
      },
